WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.381 --> 00:00:03.165
Unit twelve. Healthy Aging!

2
00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:08.844
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:12.951
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.001 --> 00:00:16.667
Today we learn about Healthy Aging. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.385 --> 00:00:20.969
Aging. Say it with me. Aging!

6
00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:28.809
Older adults. Say it with me. Older adults!

7
00:00:32.328 --> 00:00:36.144
Activity. Say it with me. Activity!

8
00:00:39.621 --> 00:00:44.671
Social connection. Say it with me. Social connection!

9
00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:51.940
Nutrition. Say it with me. Nutrition!

10
00:00:55.442 --> 00:00:59.292
Memory. Say it with me. Memory!

11
00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:06.595
Falls. Say it with me. Falls!

12
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:14.520
Independence. Say it with me. Independence!

13
00:01:18.019 --> 00:01:29.914
Healthy aging depends on activity, social connection, and nutrition. Staying mentally active supports memory, and preventing falls helps older adults keep their independence.

14
00:01:29.964 --> 00:01:33.267
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:34.023 --> 00:01:39.322
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.372 --> 00:01:40.522
Activity!

17
00:01:41.778 --> 00:01:47.115
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.165 --> 00:01:48.315
Falls!

19
00:01:49.227 --> 00:01:55.407
Did you know? Staying socially connected is linked to better health in older age!

20
00:01:55.457 --> 00:01:57.917
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:58.894 --> 00:02:07.412
Think and answer. How can young people support older family members?

22
00:02:07.462 --> 00:02:08.612
Great answer!

23
00:02:09.651 --> 00:02:15.321
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:15.371 --> 00:02:18.116
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

